      "message": "I have some ideas to ask.\n\nhope we can change it to 2, or use ifdef determine  P1 and P2.\ncan i use \u0027BUILD_ASSERT(ARRAY_SIZE(thermal_params) \u003e\u003d TEMP_SENSOR_COUNT)\u0027?\nIf neither,what to do it?\n\nThe define of P1 and P2 sensor adc is different, will it affect their test?",
